iso-kit.mjs comes from Anatomy (https://github.com/wheresryan22/anatomy), file kit/iso-kit.mjs,
copied without changes (apart from its two-line header) under the MIT License (see LICENSE). It
provides the isometric camera, the solids and the SVG string helpers used by the figures in this
folder.

theme.mjs (the book page, palettes and callouts), draw.mjs (the line-drawing parts) and the scene
modules pr-line.mjs, stack-rack.mjs, org-row.mjs, crate-shelf.mjs and contrib-grid.mjs are specific
to this profile; they follow the "technical book" design of benmacha.tn.

The fonts in fonts/ are latin subsets, as served by Google Fonts, embedded in each generated SVG,
all licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1:
- Nunito ExtraBold, by The Nunito Project Authors (fonts/OFL-Nunito.txt)
- Mulish Regular and Bold, by The Mulish Project Authors (fonts/OFL-Mulish.txt)
- JetBrains Mono Regular, by The JetBrains Mono Project Authors (fonts/OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt)
